    "# **Variables**\n",
    "## **Use multiple assignment to condense variables all set to the same value**\n",
    "**❌ DON'T**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "49ef7a75",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x = \"foo\"\n",
    "y = \"foo\"\n",
    "z = \"foo\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95a1a955",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**✔️ DO**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
